# Frontend build artifacts. Anchored to the directory rather than bare patterns: an
# unanchored name matches at every depth, which is how a bare `lib` silently excluded
# frontend/src/lib/ (all of App.jsx's imports) and broke the CI build.
/frontend/node_modules/
/frontend/dist/
